 "text": {
  "🔌  Devices": "🔌  设备",
  "📈  Statistics": "📈  统计",
  "🔧  Settings": "🔧  设置",
  "💾  Installation": "💾  安装",
  "📝  Logs": "📝  日志",
  "🐞  Debug": "🐞  调试",
  "ℹ  About": "ℹ  关于",
  "Resolution": "分辨率",
  "Preferred framerate": "首选帧率",
  "Codec preset": "编解码预设",
  "Encoder preset": "编码器预设",
  "Foveation preset": "注视点预设",
  "Headset speaker": "头显扬声器",
  "Headset microphone": "头显麦克风",
  "Hand tracking interaction": "手势模拟手柄",
  "Eye and face tracking": "眼动与面部追踪",
  "Tip": "提示",
  "If you started having crashes after changing some settings, reset ALVR by re-running \"Run setup wizard\" from the \"Installation\" tab and clicking \"Reset settings\".": "如果改过设置后开始崩溃，可在「安装」页重新点「运行设置向导」并选择「重置设置」来恢复 ALVR。",
  "Some settings are hidden by default. Click the \"Expand\" button next to some settings to expand the submenus.": "部分设置默认是隐藏的。点设置旁边的「展开」按钮可以看到子项。",
  "It's highly advisable to keep audio settings as default in ALVR and modify the default audio device in the taskbar tray.": "建议保持 ALVR 的音频设置为默认，改在任务栏托盘的默认音频设备里调整。",
  "Increasing \"Video\"->\"Maximum buffering\" may reduce stutters at the cost of more latency.": "调高「视频 > 最大缓冲帧数」可以减少卡顿，但会增加延迟。",
  "Sometimes switching between h264 and HEVC codecs is necessary on certain GPUs to fix crashing or fallback to software encoding.": "某些显卡上在 h264 与 HEVC 之间切换是必要的，可以修复崩溃或回退到软件编码。",
  "If you're using an NVIDIA GPU, it's best to use high-bitrate H264; if you're using an AMD GPU, HEVC might look better.": "用 NVIDIA 显卡建议走高码率 H264；用 AMD 显卡 HEVC 画质可能更好。",
  "If you experience \"white snow\" flickering, set \"Presets\"->\"Resolution\" to \"Low\" and disable \"Video\"->\"Foveated encoding\".": "如果出现「白雪花」闪烁，把「预设 > 分辨率」设为「低」，并关闭「视频 > 注视点编码」。",
  "Increasing \"Video\"->\"Color correction\"->\"Sharpness\" may improve the perceived image quality.": "调高「视频 > 色彩校正 > 锐化」可以提升观感清晰度。",
  "If you have problems syncing external controllers or trackers to ALVR tracking space, add one element to \"Headset\"->\"Extra OpenVR properties\", then set a custom \"Tracking system name string\".": "如果外部手柄或追踪器无法与 ALVR 追踪空间对齐，在「头显 > 额外 OpenVR 属性」里加一条，并设置自定义的「追踪系统名称」。",
  "To change the visual appearance of controllers, set \"Headset\"->\"Controllers\"->\"Emulation mode\".": "想改手柄的外观模型，请设置「头显 > 手柄 > 模拟模式」。",
  "ALVR supports custom button bindings! If you need help, please ask us on our Discord server.": "ALVR 支持自定义按键绑定！需要帮助可以到我们的 Discord 提问。",
  "ALVR supports hand tracking gestures (\"Presets\"->\"Hand tracking interaction\"->\"ALVR bindings\"). Check out wiki how to use them properly: https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR/wiki/Hand-tracking-controller-bindings.": "ALVR 支持手势追踪（「预设 > 手势模拟手柄 > ALVR 绑定」）。用法见 wiki：https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR/wiki/Hand-tracking-controller-bindings",
  "If hand tracking gestures are annoying, you can disable them in \"Headset\"->\"Controllers\"->\"Hand tracking interaction\". Alternatively, you can enable \"Hand tracking interaction\"->\"Only touch\".": "如果手势操作太烦，可以在「头显 > 手柄 > 手势模拟手柄」里关闭，也可以开启其中的「仅触摸」。",
  "You can fine-tune the controllers' responsiveness with \"Headset\"->\"Controllers\"->\"Prediction\".": "可以用「头显 > 手柄 > 预测」微调手柄的跟手程度。",
  "If the visual controller/hand models do not match the physical controller's position, you can tweak the offset in \"Headset\"->\"Controllers\"->\"Left controller position/rotation offset\" (affects both controllers).": "如果手柄或手部模型与实际手柄位置对不上，可以在「头显 > 手柄 > 左手柄位置/旋转偏移」里调整（同时影响两只手柄）。",
  "When using external trackers or controllers, you should set both \"Headset\"->\"Position/Rotation recentering mode\" to \"Disabled\".": "使用外部追踪器或手柄时，应把「头显 > 位置/旋转居中模式」设为「禁用」。",
  "You can enable tilt mode. Set \"Headset\"->\"Position recentering mode\" to \"Local\" and \"Headset\"->\"Rotation recentering mode\" to \"Tilted\".": "可以开启倾斜模式：把「头显 > 位置居中模式」设为「本地」，「旋转居中模式」设为「倾斜」。",
  "If you often experience image glitching, you can trade that with stutter frames using \"Connection\"->\"Avoid video glitching\".": "如果经常出现画面撕裂，可以用「连接 > 避免画面撕裂」以少量掉帧换取稳定。",
  "You can run custom commands/programs at headset connection/disconnection using \"Connection\"->\"Enable on connect/disconnect script\".": "可以用「连接 > 启用连接时脚本 / 启用断开时脚本」在头显连接或断开时执行自定义命令。",
  "In case you want to report a bug, to get a log file, enable \"Extra\"->\"Logging\"->\"Log to disk\". The log will be inside \"session_log.txt\".": "要报 bug 需要日志时，开启「其他 > 日志 > 写入日志文件」，日志在 session_log.txt 里。",
  "For hacking purposes, you can enable \"Extra\"->\"Logging\"->\"Log tracking\", \"Log button presses\" and \"Log haptics\". You can get the data using a websocket at ws://localhost:8082/api/events.": "做逆向调试可开启「其他 > 日志 > 记录追踪数据 / 记录按键 / 记录震动」，数据可通过 ws://localhost:8082/api/events 获取。",
  "In case you want to report a bug and share your log, you should enable \"Extra\"->\"Logging\"->\"Prefer backtrace\".": "报 bug 并要分享日志时，应开启「其他 > 日志 > 优先显示调用栈」。",
  "You can quickly cycle through tips like this one by toggling \"Extra\"->\"Logging\"->\"Show notification tip\".": "切换「其他 > 日志 > 显示通知提示」可以快速轮换这类提示。",
  "It's handy to enable \"Extra\"->\"SteamVR Launcher\"->\"Open and close SteamVR automatically\".": "建议开启「其他 > SteamVR 启动 > 自动开关 SteamVR」。",
  "If you want to share a video recording for reporting a bug, you can enable \"Extra\"->\"Capture\"->\"Rolling video files\" to limit the file size of the upload.": "想分享录像来报 bug 时，可以开启「其他 > 录制 > 循环录像文件」限制文件大小。",
  "If your headset does not appear in the device list, it might be in a different subnet. Try \"Add device manually\" with IP shown from inside device.": "如果头显没出现在设备列表里，可能处在不同网段。可以试「手动添加设备」，填头显里显示的 IP。",
  "Disabling foveated encoding may result in significantly higher encode/decode times and stuttering, or even crashing.\nIf you want to reduce the amount of pixelation on the edges, increase the center region width and height.\nFor eye-tracked foveation, enable Headset > Face tracking > Sink > Eye-tracked foveated encoding.": "关闭注视点编码可能显著增加编解码耗时并造成卡顿，甚至崩溃。\n想减少边缘的像素化，请调大中心区域的宽和高。\n要使用眼动注视点，请启用「头显 > 面部追踪 > 输出 > 眼动注视点编码」。",
  "To be able to use the microphone on Windows, you need to install Virtual Audio Cable\"\n        ))\n    )]\n    #[cfg_attr(not(windows), schema(strings(display_name = \"Headset microphone\")))]\n    pub microphone: Switch<MicrophoneConfig>,\n}\n\n#[derive(SettingsSchema, Serialize, Deserialize, Clone)]\npub enum HeadsetEmulationMode {\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Rift S\"))]\n    RiftS,\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Quest 1\"))]\n    Quest1,\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Quest 2\"))]\n    Quest2,\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Quest Pro\"))]\n    QuestPro,\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Pico 4\"))]\n    Pico4,\n    Vive,\n    Custom {\n        serial_number: String,\n    },\n}\n\n#[derive(SettingsSchema, Serialize, Deserialize, PartialEq, Clone)]\npub enum PerformanceLevel {\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Power Saving\"))]\n    PowerSavings,\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Sustained Low\"))]\n    SustainedLow,\n    #[schema(strings(display_name = \"Sustained High\"))]\n    SustainedHigh,\n    #[schema(flag = \"hidden\")]\n    Boost,\n}\n\n#[derive(SettingsSchema, Serialize, Deserialize, PartialEq, Clone)]\npub struct PerformanceLevelConfig {\n    #[schema(flag = \"real-time\")]\n    #[schema(strings(\n        display_name = \"CPU\",\n        help = \"When disabling this, the client needs to be restarted for the change to be applied.": "要在 Windows 上使用麦克风，需要先安装 Virtual Audio Cable",
  "AV1 encoding is only supported on RDNA3, Ada Lovelace, Intel ARC or newer GPUs (AMD RX 7xxx+ , NVIDIA RTX 40xx+, Intel ARC)\nand on headsets that have XR2 Gen 2 onboard (Quest 3, Pico 4 Ultra).\n\nH264 encoding is currently NOT supported on Intel ARC GPUs on Windows.": "AV1 编码仅支持 RDNA3、Ada Lovelace、Intel ARC 或更新的 GPU（AMD RX 7xxx+、NVIDIA RTX 40xx+、Intel ARC），\n以及搭载 XR2 Gen 2 的头显（Quest 3、Pico 4 Ultra）。\n\nWindows 上 Intel ARC 显卡目前不支持 H264 编码。",
  "You can change the default audio device from the system taskbar tray (bottom right)": "可以在系统任务栏托盘（右下角）切换默认音频设备",
  "ALVR requires running SteamVR! Devices will not be discovered or connected.": "ALVR 需要 SteamVR 正在运行！否则无法搜索和连接头显。",
